<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―That night, when I got home, Mom was waiting for me, close to tears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even Dad, who'd been away on a business trip, had come back, and on top of that, the police were there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had turned into a much bigger fuss than I'd thought.<PG>
That was because I had completely forgotten I'd turned my phone off for the filming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My parents apologized to the police over and over, but the officers said they were glad nothing had happened and went back.<PG>
That day, I got scolded, as you'd expect.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since that incident, my parents had stopped scolding me, but I was scolded for hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in the end, they were glad I had come back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than the scolding, it was having made them sad, and then having made them glad, that <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="こた">hit me hard</STYLE>.<PG>
When I told them I wanted to enter Japonica TV's eating contest, my parents' faces brightened even more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it was an eating contest, they were very happy that I'd chosen to take on a challenge of my own will.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That same day, I sent Ukai-san an official email saying I would take part.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The next day, at the usual diner.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\食堂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE>, I hear you're entering the eating contest!
{PAUSE ""}
　Here, this is our special training menu!
{PAUSE ""}
　You'll win for sure, <STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What he set in front of me were dishes that looked hard to eat, made with octopus and thick-cut meat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with no time to train, eating things like this would let me picture it.<PG>
I gave the owner a big grin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh! <STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE>, I haven't seen that face in a long time! I'm rooting for you all the way!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had been a long time since I'd smiled like this, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed I had more people on my side than I'd thought.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\掲示板.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:15</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">heard one of our grads is entering the next eating contest!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:20</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">for real!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:25</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">erina goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, anybody know her?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:27</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">oh, that legendary genius girl, right?</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s a big eater too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:30</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">definitely watching! or how about we make a cheer squad and go to tokyo?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shiyo 804, May 21　19:32</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">oh! it's a chance to show off motoki-cho on live tv!</STYLE><PG>
Even the Motoki High School message board had posts about me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just from eating a lot, Motoki-cho was this fired up.<PG>
So there were still plenty of things even I could do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I absolutely can't lose! For everyone cheering me on, and for myself too, I'll become number one in Japan!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The next week, the day before the contest<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>, good luck!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I put on my shoes, Mom's cheering hit me in the back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom's eyes were already teary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">“I'll win for sure!”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered Mom in sign language.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
―Okay, I'm off!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I left the house with my head held high.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the way to Motoki Station, lots of people called out to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The genius girl is back!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\塾前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll be cheering for you in front of the TV!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE>! Here, take this with you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Familiar faces I passed cheered me on, or gave me <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たむ">send-off</STYLE> gifts.<PG>
And I had tried, even once, to leave this place...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving Motoki-cho, with so many wonderful people in it, is unimaginable to me now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\駅ホーム.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\元木駅.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―On the platform at Motoki Station, there was a group holding a big banner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto-san</STYLE>! On behalf of the people of Motoki-cho, I offer you our encouragement!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is the mayor...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never imagined I'd get support at the level of the local government...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So Motoki-cho's complacency from too much peace has come this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I realized again how much I was carrying on my back, my fighting spirit finally surged.<PG>
How was I, without a voice, supposed to respond?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grinned as big as I could and waved hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\clapping-hands1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Then a big cheer rose from the cheering squad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, Motoki-cho is shaking for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I am shaking Motoki-cho.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "160" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車停止.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I will definitely win!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that war cry in my heart, I boarded the train.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―My second time in Tokyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京駅.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\東京駅.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Stepping off at the station, I took a deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Completely different from the air last time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This breath wasn't because I was suffocating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a breath to take into myself the vigor of the myriad gods drifting through the air.<PG>
Okay!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="たた">slapped</STYLE> my cheeks with both hands and headed for the ticket gates.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京駅改札.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\東京駅改札.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And there beyond the gates stood the director, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="うかい">Ukai</STYLE>-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE>! Thank you so much for coming!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Came all the way out here just to meet me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To answer that courtesy with everything I had, I grinned as we shook hands.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE>, your face is totally different from last time!
{PAUSE ""}
　Great, great! Do your best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just me smiling really does change the impression a lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bus was apparently waiting outside the station, so I headed where I'd been told.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス外観.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Apparently the TV station was putting us up tonight at a hotel they had arranged, and we were heading there now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス車内.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Several people who looked like contestants were already seated on the bus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A large man who looked every inch the big eater.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A slender, gentle-looking man so thin you'd doubt he could really eat much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス車内椅子.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A fair-skinned woman with a graceful air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow she looked foreign...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The seat next to her happened to be free, so I sat down there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Hello."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">The woman</STYLE> greeted me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bowed without a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">This woman</STYLE> really was different from a Japanese person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her facial features, for one, and her eyes were blue.<PG>
Was even someone like her entering the eating contest?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then again, I'm entering with a small build like this, so she may be strong despite her looks.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Could it be that you can't speak?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="8">the woman</STYLE> spoke to me in sign language.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">“Do you understand sign language?”</STYLE> she asked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was surprised, and at the same time, it was the first time I'd met someone outside my family and social workers who could sign.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">“Nice to meet you. My name is Erina Goto. I can hear, but I can't speak.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I replied in sign language.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Oh, then we won't have any trouble communicating. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">My name is Chigaya Niimura. Pleased to meet you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Same surname as <STYLE ID="9">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there must be any number of people named Niimura if you go looking.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バス車内.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
On the bus, they handed out tomorrow's schedule.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From 10 a.m., the qualifier, 30 minutes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From 7 p.m., the final, 60 minutes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both broadcast live nationwide.<PG>
So I have to eat to my limit twice in one day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with 8 and a half hours in between, this is pretty tough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of that, the qualifier is a narrow gate, cutting 100 people down to three.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And what we'll be eating won't be revealed until right before the start.<PG>
It was only the day before, and the nerves were building already.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could feel my stomach clench up tight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tomorrow I'll be even more nervous, and my stomach will probably shrink up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do now is get myself, by tomorrow, into a condition where I can eat even when I'm nervous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What ways are there?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ホテル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Eventually the bus pulled up in front of tonight's hotel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We'll come pick you up here at 8 tomorrow, so please have your checkout done by then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like we were dismissed here for the day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There didn't seem to be any pre-interviews or eve-of-contest party either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, let's both do our best tomorrow."</STYLE>
